#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:5 98807f3544234e9facdacdb7391d79d7
msgid "RTL Mode"
msgstr "RTL模式"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:7 7133e7b4627344288f41404f8f9197dc
msgid ""
"RTL mode (Return To Launch mode) navigates Copter from its current position "
"to hover above the home position. The behavior of RTL mode can be controlled"
" by several adjustable parameters. This page describes how to use and "
"customize RTL mode."
msgstr ""
"RTL模式（返回起飞点模式）将飞行器从当前位置导航回起飞点上方悬停。RTL模式的行为可通过多个可调参数进行控制。本页面介绍如何使用和自定义RTL模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:13 69ff560864fb4fff93960951debc451a
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:15 c23d3997fd29484e879bd928d58a485e
msgid ""
"When RTL mode is selected, the copter will return to the home location, or "
"if :ref:`rally points <common-rally-points>` have been setup, the closest "
"rally point."
msgstr ""
"选择 RTL 模式后，飞行器将返回 Home 位置；如果已设置 :ref:`集结点 <common-rally-points>`，则返回最近的集结点。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:17 727d91a8908743488c6abb3ff7ddc3d5
msgid ""
"The copter will first rise a minimum of :ref:`RTL_CLIMB_MIN<RTL_CLIMB_MIN>` "
"or to  :ref:`RTL_ALT_M<RTL_ALT_M>`, whichever is higher, before returning "
"home.  The default value for :ref:`RTL_ALT_M<RTL_ALT_M>` is 15m. Under no "
"circumstances will this altitude be below 30cm."
msgstr ""
"飞行器将首先爬升至 :ref:`RTL_CLIMB_MIN<RTL_CLIMB_MIN>` 与 :ref:`RTL_ALT_M<RTL_ALT_M>` "
"中的较高者，然后再返回 Home。:ref:`RTL_ALT_M<RTL_ALT_M>` 的默认值为 15 米。此高度在任何情况下均不会低于 30 "
"厘米。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:19 3ca5d39584ba404cb15020583f6699c5
msgid ""
"The altitude reference frame is set by either the rally point, if proceeding"
" to one of those, or by :ref:`RTL_ALT_TYPE<RTL_ALT_TYPE>` to select relative"
" to HOME, or Terrain. If :ref:`WP_RFND_USE<WP_RFND_USE>` = 1 and Terrain is "
"selected, then rangefinder will be used."
msgstr ""
"高度参考系由集结点（如果前往集结点）设定，或由 :ref:`RTL_ALT_TYPE<RTL_ALT_TYPE>` 选择相对于 HOME "
"或相对于地形。如果 :ref:`WP_RFND_USE<WP_RFND_USE>` = 1 且选择了地形，则将使用测距仪。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:24 a2e0e429b6d8455dafb6106770b17e7b
msgid ""
"If RTL is entered close to its return point, the altitude Copter climbs to "
"may be limited to avoid unneeded climbs and descents. The "
":ref:`RTL_CONE_SLOPE<RTL_CONE_SLOPE>` parameter determines the slope of an "
"inverted cone centered on the return point. This reduces the above return "
"altitude according to: distance from return point * "
":ref:`RTL_CONE_SLOPE<RTL_CONE_SLOPE>`. So if the mode is entered 10m from "
"the return point, using the default slope of \"3\", then the altitude rise "
"would be limited to 30m before returning. It may be less depending on the "
"other parameters, but not higher. If the slope were set to \"0.5\", then the"
" initial climb would be no higher than 5m altitude before proceeding to the "
"return point. A value of \"0\" disables this limit. \"0.5\" is the minimum "
"slope. Again, 2m is the minimum return altitude."
msgstr ""
"如果在距返航点较近处进入RTL，为避免不必要的爬升和下降，飞行器爬升的高度可能受到限制。:ref:`RTL_CONE_SLOPE<RTL_CONE_SLOPE>`"
" 参数定义了以返航点为中心的倒锥斜率。该参数根据与返航点的距离乘以 :ref:`RTL_CONE_SLOPE<RTL_CONE_SLOPE>` "
"来限制上述返航高度。例如，若在距返航点10米处进入该模式，默认斜率为\"3\"，则高度爬升最多限制为30米再返回。实际高度可能因其他参数而更低，但不会更高。若斜率设为\"0.5\"，则前往返航点前的初始爬升高度不超过5米。值\"0\"禁用此限制，\"0.5\"为最小斜率。同样，最小返航高度为2米。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:26 8c1a701b1e7d4dae9e79843467bf1d10
msgid ""
"If an :ref:`altitude fence <common-geofencing-landing-page>` has been "
"enabled, the RTL climb/return altitude will be limited to be below the "
"fence's maximum altitude."
msgstr ""
"如果启用了 :ref:`高度围栏 <common-geofencing-landing-page>`，RTL "
"的爬升/返航高度将被限制在围栏最大高度以下。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:28 ed214df382544b35889f58ab8ea9c428
msgid ""
"RTL mode requires a reliable position estimate to work properly, most "
"commonly provided by GPS and compass. Default prearm checks will ensure a 3D"
" GPS lock with sufficient HDOP is acquired and your mag is working as "
"expected prior to arming, if required by the selected mode and configuration"
" during arming (ie STABILIZE could be armed without a reliable position and "
"a switch into RTL would be refused without it). When using non-default "
"arming checks, make sure you do have a sufficient GPS lock and / or a "
"reliable position estimate for RTL to perform as expected."
msgstr ""
"RTL 模式需要可靠的位置估计才能正常工作，通常由 GPS 和罗盘提供。如果解锁时所选模式和配置有此要求，默认预解锁检查将确保在解锁前已获得 HDOP "
"足够的 3D GPS 锁定且磁罗盘工作正常（例如 STABILIZE 无需可靠位置即可解锁，但没有可靠位置时切换到 RTL "
"会被拒绝）。使用非默认解锁检查时，请确保具有足够的 GPS 锁定和/或可靠的位置估计，以便 RTL 按预期执行。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:30 7ddfcbbe845f4082953496b7e75fdfc0
msgid ""
"RTL will command the copter to return to the home position, meaning that it "
"will return to the location where it was armed. Therefore, the home position"
" is always supposed to be your copter's actual GPS takeoff location, "
"unobstructed and away from people. For Copter if you get GPS lock and then "
"ARM your copter, the home position is the location the copter was in when it"
" was armed. This means if you execute an RTL in Copter, it will return to "
"the location where it was armed."
msgstr ""
"RTL将命令飞行器返回Home位置，即返回解锁时所在的位置。因此，Home位置应始终是飞行器实际的GPS起飞位置，且无遮挡、远离人群。对于Copter，如果已获得GPS锁定后解锁，Home位置即为解锁时飞行器所在位置。这意味着在Copter中执行RTL时，飞行器将返回解锁时所在的位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:40 5550e666ed9149468607352125b09683
msgid ""
"In RTL mode the autopilot uses a barometer which measures air pressure as "
"the primary means for determining altitude (\"Pressure Altitude\") and if "
"the air pressure is changing in your flight area, the copter will follow the"
" air pressure change rather than actual altitude (unless you are within 20 "
"feet of the ground and have SONAR installed and enabled)."
msgstr ""
"在RTL模式下，飞控主要使用气压计（测量气压）来确定高度（\"气压高度\"）。如果您飞行区域的气压发生变化，飞行器将跟随气压变化而非实际高度飞行（除非您在距地面20英尺以内且已安装并启用声呐）。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:48 c886474589cd47059a4d11b37911a3d7
msgid "Options (User Adjustable Parameters)"
msgstr "选项（用户可调参数）"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:50 398680ed78f644cd898c209f3bfc4c70
msgid ""
":ref:`RTL_ALT_M<RTL_ALT_M>`: The minimum altitude the copter will move to "
"before returning to launch."
msgstr ":ref:`RTL_ALT_M<RTL_ALT_M>`：飞行器返回起飞点前爬升到的最低高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:53 b008a732eda346708c06b587846695b5
msgid "Set to zero to return at the current altitude."
msgstr "设为零则以当前高度返回。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:54 5cb4f96c892243eaad1aac9a4c9f0f30
msgid "The return altitude can be set from 0.3 to 3000 meters."
msgstr "返回高度可设置为 0.3 至 3000 米。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:55 824716a7237e4915939b7bfaff5abdff
msgid "The default return altitude Default is 15 meters."
msgstr "默认返回高度为 15 米。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:57 0f4ffddd4e854125a1d625bd7d7fa3be
msgid ""
":ref:`RTL_ALT_FINAL_M<RTL_ALT_FINAL_M>`: The altitude the copter will move "
"to at the final stage of \"Returning to Launch\" or after completing a "
"Mission."
msgstr ":ref:`RTL_ALT_FINAL_M<RTL_ALT_FINAL_M>`：飞行器在\"返回起飞点\"最终阶段或完成任务后移动到的高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:61 aab52fae5a0a41a58fb0c0aaad5975b3
msgid "Set to zero to automatically land the copter. See :ref:`land-mode`."
msgstr "设为零则自动降落。参见 :ref:`land-mode`。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:62 1f5afd42f13544019521e6c85cff4ee6
msgid "The final return altitude may be adjusted from 0 to 10 meters."
msgstr "最终返回高度可在 0 至 10 米之间调整。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:65 1b4a09c370a545048d0381f11fa71568
msgid ""
":ref:`RTL_LOIT_TIME <RTL_LOIT_TIME>`: Time in milliseconds to hover/pause "
"above the \"Home\" position before beginning final descent."
msgstr ":ref:`RTL_LOIT_TIME <RTL_LOIT_TIME>`：在开始最终下降之前，在\"Home\"位置上方悬停/暂停的时间（毫秒）。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:69 3c8c6f51807047ce9f72e56fe46ad78d
msgid "The \"Loiter\" time may be adjusted from 0 to 60,000 milliseconds."
msgstr "\"悬停\"时间可在0至60,000毫秒之间调整。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:71 a3406b9438cf4e52957f40f6164e21dd
msgid ""
":ref:`WP_YAW_BEHAVIOR <WP_YAW_BEHAVIOR>`: Sets how the autopilot controls "
"the \"Yaw\" during Missions and RTL."
msgstr ":ref:`WP_YAW_BEHAVIOR <WP_YAW_BEHAVIOR>`：设置飞控在任务和RTL期间如何控制\"偏航\"。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:74 b7f35dc9356b4d14a816e6e91b401ac4
msgid "0 = Never change Yaw."
msgstr "0 = 从不改变偏航。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:75 e8286ea024c3467e8bc565b086bbbb3f
msgid "1 = Face Next Waypoint including facing home during RTL."
msgstr "1 = 朝向下一个航点，包括RTL时朝向Home。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:76 d609400e9a9147aabc4d3e81a862a998
msgid ""
"2 = Face Next Waypoint except for RTL (i.e. during RTL vehicle will remain "
"pointed at its last heading)"
msgstr "2 = 朝向下一个航点，但RTL时除外（即RTL期间飞行器将保持最后的航向）。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:79 8d79c774aae244aab374c9fb482884ec
msgid ""
":ref:`LAND_SPD_MS<LAND_SPD_MS>`: The descent speed for the final stage of "
"landing in centimeters per second."
msgstr ":ref:`LAND_SPD_MS<LAND_SPD_MS>`：降落最终阶段的下降速度，单位为厘米/秒。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:83 de57da6c50e141078209f6aa735d3140
msgid "The landing speed is adjustable from 0.3 to 2 meters per second."
msgstr "降落速度可在 0.3 至 2 米/秒之间调整。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:86 f3e5d135d4414f61a3b370fa3b08cb54
msgid ""
":ref:`RTL_CLIMB_MIN <RTL_CLIMB_MIN>`: The vehicle will climb at least this "
"many meters at the first stage of the RTL.  By default this value is zero."
msgstr ":ref:`RTL_CLIMB_MIN <RTL_CLIMB_MIN>`：飞行器在RTL第一阶段至少爬升的米数。默认值为零。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:90 80996f656a91439c9821e0fac10703a4
msgid ""
":ref:`RTL_SPEED <RTL_SPEED>`: The horizontal speed (in cm/s) at which the "
"vehicle will return to home.  By default this value is zero meaning it will "
"use :ref:`WP_SPD<WP_SPD>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`RTL_SPEED <RTL_SPEED>`：飞行器返回 Home 的水平速度（单位 cm/s）。默认值为零，表示使用 "
":ref:`WP_SPD<WP_SPD>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:95 7babf54d0a004f17a870bf6c1f697292
msgid ""
":ref:`RTL_CONE_SLOPE <RTL_CONE_SLOPE>`: Defines the slope of an inverted "
"cone above home which is used to limit the amount the vehicle climbs when "
"RTL-ing from close to home. Low values lead to a wide cone meaning the "
"vehicle will climb less, High values will lead to the vehicle climbing more."
msgstr ""
":ref:`RTL_CONE_SLOPE "
"<RTL_CONE_SLOPE>`：定义Home上方倒锥的斜率，用于限制从近处RTL时的爬升量。低值导致锥体较宽（爬升较少），高值导致爬升较多。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:102 649fdafcc89e4973891a735631ae140b
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "注意事项"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:104 d5379faa52f04ae5a748126c1bf87985
msgid "Other navigation settings also have an influence over RTL mode:"
msgstr "其他导航设置也会影响RTL模式："

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:106 4e77727d9c114cfcaa7036a4b3c49ec6
msgid ":ref:`WP_ACC<WP_ACC>`"
msgstr ":ref:`WP_ACC<WP_ACC>`"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:107 ff21836d122d4298997d84b1f12b9003
msgid ":ref:`WP_SPD_DN<WP_SPD_DN>`"
msgstr ":ref:`WP_SPD_DN<WP_SPD_DN>`"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:108 8806684d19b642ddab95c75eec49ad25
msgid ":ref:`WP_SPD_UP<WP_SPD_UP>`"
msgstr ":ref:`WP_SPD_UP<WP_SPD_UP>`"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:110 eaecc4611afb4abaa77ac51322ef3d0e
msgid ""
"To use RTL, GPS lock needs to be achieved (Blue GPS LED and Blue APM LED on "
"solid not blinking) before arming and takeoff to establish the home or "
"launch position."
msgstr "使用RTL前，需要在解锁和起飞前获得GPS锁定（GPS蓝色LED和APM蓝色LED常亮不闪），以建立Home或起飞位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:113 6e7b77d3a2874f59a15b4e9a6c2faa7f
msgid ""
"Landing and re-arming the copter will reset home, which is a great feature "
"for flying at airfields."
msgstr "降落并重新解锁将重置Home位置，这对在机场飞行非常实用。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:115 1cbbc5272221404e97ac89f3fcca37b2
msgid ""
"If you get lock for the first time while flying, your home will be set at "
"the location of lock."
msgstr "如果您在飞行中首次获得 GPS 锁定，Home 将被设置在锁定时的位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:117 ec7fba5f17aa47ca9aed90b99c44c073
msgid ""
"If you set the :ref:`RTL_ALT_M<RTL_ALT_M>` to a number at other than 0 it "
"will go to and maintain that altitude while returning."
msgstr "如果将 :ref:`RTL_ALT_M<RTL_ALT_M>` 设置为非 0 值，飞行器将前往并保持该高度返回。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:119 93ec032f56eb48f8a522c5f589540964
msgid "RTL uses :ref:`WP_SPD<WP_SPD>` to determine how fast it travels."
msgstr "RTL 使用 :ref:`WP_SPD<WP_SPD>` 来确定飞行速度。"

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:120 ac1e0e35e3d142488ea204a54a6e1638
msgid ""
"Once the copter arrives at the home location the copter will pause for "
"``RTL_LOIT_TIME`` milliseconds, timeout (AUTO_LAND), then land."
msgstr "飞行器到达Home位置后，将暂停 ``RTL_LOIT_TIME`` 毫秒，超时（AUTO_LAND）后降落。"
